; Weather -- rain, mist, wetness and wind for a level's exterior, from one
; Weather component per world. Drives the renderer's own Volumetric Fog,
; the scene block's wind and wetness (RenderCore's RenderWeather.h) and a
; camera-following particle rain.

[Plugin]
Name=Weather
Version=0.1.0
EngineVersion=0.1
Category=Rendering
Description=Rain, mist, wet surfaces and wind from a Weather component: drives Volumetric Fog, foliage wind and wetness
EnabledByDefault=false

[Module_Weather]
Type=Runtime
